Construction and quality coordination review","phase":"Construction and quality coordination","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review actual works, interfaces and quality evidence and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"Acceptance and handover materials","phase":"Acceptance, handover and use","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review completed works, remaining items, maintenance information and receiving ownership. Deliver: acceptance and handover package."},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"Use observation and defect maintenance","phase":"Acceptance, handover and use","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Record use feedback, defects and maintenance issues and propose approved follow-up treatment. Deliver: use and defect maintenance record."},{"id":"p6_review","name":"Acceptance, handover and use review","phase":"Acceptance, handover and use","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review handover completeness and use feedback and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"exception_action","name":"Change, quality and site correction","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review design, quality or site issues, hold affected work and propose authorized correction and reinspection."},{"id":"exception_review","name":"Recovery and readiness review","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Check impact, response evidence and recovery status. Identify reviews to repeat and obtain authorized confirmation before resuming."}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"Exception response"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Confirmed re-review"}]}'::jsonb),
('recruitment-selection-advanced','0774763e15441d591fe7998c9f81d25c','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"用人目标与岗位需求","phase":"用人需求与岗位","kind":"activity","responsibility":"明确岗位目标、能力、职责与团队需求，确认招聘是否适合解决问题。交付：岗位与用人需求。"},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"招聘条件与评价标准","phase":"用人需求与岗位","kind":"activity","responsibility":"约定岗位条件、评价标准和参与职责，核对适用的招聘程序。交付：评价标准与招聘条件。"},{"id":"p1_review","name":"用人需求与岗位评审","phase":"用人需求与岗位","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对岗位目的、能力和招聘边界并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"岗位发布与渠道安排","phase":"渠道与甄选准备","kind":"activity","responsibility":"准备准确岗位信息、渠道、时间和候选人沟通，记录来源。交付：发布与渠道计划。"},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"结构化题目与任务","phase":"渠道与甄选准备","kind":"activity","responsibility":"设计与岗位相关的题目、实践任务和评分依据，统一评估方法。交付：结构化评估材料。"},{"id":"p2_review","name":"渠道与甄选准备评审","phase":"渠道与甄选准备","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对信息一致性与可用评估工具并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"申请材料与初筛","phase":"候选筛选与沟通","kind":"activity","responsibility":"按确认标准核对候选材料，登记岗位匹配证据与缺口。交付：候选筛选记录。"},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"候选沟通与面试准备","phase":"候选筛选与沟通","kind":"activity","responsibility":"确认候选意向、安排、评估说明和资料处理方式。交付：候选沟通与评估安排。"},{"id":"p3_review","name":"候选筛选与沟通评审","phase":"候选筛选与沟通","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对岗位相关证据与评估安排并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"岗位技能与实践评价","phase":"多方评价","kind":"activity","responsibility":"依据岗位任务核对技能和实践表现，按相同标准记录评价。交付：岗位能力评价记录。"},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"团队与综合面谈","phase":"多方评价","kind":"activity","responsibility":"由用人团队核对协作与相关能力，区分事实证据与主观判断。交付：团队与综合评价。"},{"id":"p4_review","name":"多方评价评审","phase":"多方评价","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对岗位能力、团队协作与证据一致性并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"评价汇总与录用依据","phase":"录用与条件确认","kind":"activity","responsibility":"对照标准汇总评价，记录分歧、选择依据与有权人的决定。交付：录用决定与依据。"},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"条件沟通与录用确认","phase":"录用与条件确认","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对岗位条件、双方确认和入职准备，登记需进一步处理的问题。交付：录用与条件确认记录。"},{"id":"p5_review","name":"录用与条件确认评审","phase":"录用与条件确认","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对评价决策与双方条件并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"入职资料与支持准备","phase":"入职与岗位接收","kind":"activity","responsibility":"准备介绍、资料、访问和培训，明确入职支持与岗位交接责任。交付：入职支持与交接包。"},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"岗位接收与招聘复盘","phase":"入职与岗位接收","kind":"activity","responsibility":"确认岗位职责接收，整理甄选、沟通和入职问题的改进建议。交付：岗位接收与招聘复盘。"},{"id":"p6_review","name":"入职与岗位接收评审","phase":"入职与岗位接收","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对入职支持与职责接收并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"exception_action","name":"候选人退出与补充甄选","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"activity","responsibility":"记录退出、拒绝或评估争议，核对需求与候选池，提出递补或重新招募安排。"},{"id":"exception_review","name":"恢复与重新准入","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对异常影响、处置证据与恢复状态，明确哪些工作需要重新评审；获得有权人确认后再进入正常推进路径。"}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"异常：专项处置"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"确认后重新评审"}]}'::jsonb),
('recruitment-selection-advanced','5d5b14cef0f750d3dd59026fda4230bd','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"Hiring goals and role requirements","phase":"Hiring needs and role","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Define role goals, competencies, responsibilities and team needs and confirm the hiring rationale. Deliver: role and hiring requirements."},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"Hiring terms and assessment criteria","phase":"Hiring needs and role","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Agree terms, assessment criteria and ownership with applicable hiring procedures. Deliver: assessment criteria and hiring terms."},{"id":"p1_review","name":"Hiring needs and role review","phase":"Hiring needs and role","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review role purpose, competencies and hiring boundaries and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"Role publication and sourcing","phase":"Sourcing and assessment readiness","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Prepare accurate role information, channels, timing and candidate communication with sources. Deliver: publication and sourcing plan."},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"Structured questions and tasks","phase":"Sourcing and assessment readiness","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Design job-related questions, work samples and scoring evidence for consistent assessment. Deliver: structured assessment materials."},{"id":"p2_review","name":"Sourcing and assessment readiness review","phase":"Sourcing and assessment readiness","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review consistent information and usable assessment tools and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"Applications and initial screening","phase":"Candidate screening and communication","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review applications against agreed criteria and record role-fit evidence and gaps. Deliver: candidate screening record."},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"Candidate communication and interview readiness","phase":"Candidate screening and communication","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Confirm interest, schedules, assessment information and appropriate handling of materials. Deliver: candidate communication and assessment plan."},{"id":"p3_review","name":"Candidate screening and communication review","phase":"Candidate screening and communication","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review job-related evidence and assessment arrangements and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"Role skills and work-sample assessment","phase":"Multi-party assessment","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Assess job skills and work samples using consistent criteria and recorded evidence. Deliver: job competency assessment."},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"Team and broader assessment","phase":"Multi-party assessment","kind":"activity","responsibility":"The hiring team evaluates collaboration and relevant skills and separates evidence from subjective impressions. Deliver: team and broader assessment."},{"id":"p4_review","name":"Multi-party assessment review","phase":"Multi-party assessment","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review competencies, collaboration and consistent evidence and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"Evaluation synthesis and offer evidence","phase":"Offer and terms confirmation","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Compare evidence with criteria and record disagreements, selection reasons and authorized decisions. Deliver: offer decision and evidence."},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"Terms discussion and offer confirmation","phase":"Offer and terms confirmation","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Confirm role terms, agreement and onboarding readiness and record remaining issues. Deliver: offer and terms confirmation."},{"id":"p5_review","name":"Offer and terms confirmation review","phase":"Offer and terms confirmation","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review selection decisions and agreed terms and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"Onboarding materials and support","phase":"Onboarding and role receipt","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Prepare introductions, materials, access and training with onboarding and role handoff ownership. Deliver: onboarding support and handoff package."},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"Role receipt and hiring retrospective","phase":"Onboarding and role receipt","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Confirm responsibility receipt and review assessment, communication and onboarding improvements. Deliver: role receipt and hiring retrospective."},{"id":"p6_review","name":"Onboarding and role receipt review","phase":"Onboarding and role receipt","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review onboarding support and responsibility receipt and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"exception_action","name":"Candidate withdrawal and additional selection","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Record withdrawal, rejection or disputed assessments and propose additional sourcing or selection against the role requirements."},{"id":"exception_review","name":"Recovery and readiness review","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Check impact, response evidence and recovery status. Identify reviews to repeat and obtain authorized confirmation before resuming."}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"Exception response"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Confirmed re-review"}]}'::jsonb),
('talent-development-advanced','3c298307e42afaf9c2f6c9e7a413ea91','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"岗位与能力盘点","phase":"能力与岗位目标","kind":"activity","responsibility":"结合岗位职责、表现和本人反馈核对能力与工作条件。交付：岗位能力与条件盘点。"},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"培养目标与支持需求","phase":"能力与岗位目标","kind":"activity","responsibility":"约定需要改善的任务、能力和衡量方法，说明组织支持需求。交付：培养目标与支持说明。"},{"id":"p1_review","name":"能力与岗位目标评审","phase":"能力与岗位目标","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对岗位表现与能力缺口并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"训练与实践路径","phase":"培养路径设计","kind":"activity","responsibility":"设计课程、导师、任务实践与阶段检查，使培养对应真实工作。交付：培养路径与实践计划。"},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"评价与反馈安排","phase":"培养路径设计","kind":"activity","responsibility":"约定阶段证据、评价标准、反馈方式和本人参与安排。交付：培养评价与反馈方案。"},{"id":"p2_review","name":"培养路径设计评审","phase":"培养路径设计","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对训练、实践与评价对应并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"学习材料与训练准备","phase":"资源与导师准备","kind":"activity","responsibility":"准备课程、案例、练习和学习支持，核对目标与材料版本。交付：学习与训练材料。"},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"导师与任务安排","phase":"资源与导师准备","kind":"activity","responsibility":"确认导师职责、任务机会、时间和工作支持，记录实际约定。交付：导师与实践安排。"},{"id":"p3_review","name":"资源与导师准备评审","phase":"资源与导师准备","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对材料、导师与实践条件并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"训练参与与过程反馈","phase":"训练与试行","kind":"activity","responsibility":"开展确认的训练和辅导，记录理解、困难与阶段成果。交付：训练过程与反馈。"},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"试行实践与观察","phase":"训练与试行","kind":"activity","responsibility":"在支持条件下完成试行任务，观察工作表现与需要改进的环节。交付：试行实践与观察。"},{"id":"p4_review","name":"训练与试行评审","phase":"训练与试行","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对训练过程与实践反馈并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"真实任务与导师观察","phase":"岗位实践与核验","kind":"activity","responsibility":"在实际工作中应用所学，记录任务结果、导师意见和阻碍。交付：岗位实践与导师记录。"},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"能力与效果核验","phase":"岗位实践与核验","kind":"activity","responsibility":"依据原目标核对能力改善，区分训练因素和工作条件变化。交付：能力与效果核验。"},{"id":"p5_review","name":"岗位实践与核验评审","phase":"岗位实践与核验","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对真实任务表现与能力改善并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"成果接收与发展约定","phase":"接收与持续发展","kind":"activity","responsibility":"确认培养成果与岗位使用安排，记录本人和负责人意见。交付：培养成果与发展约定。"},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"培养复盘与计划维护","phase":"接收与持续发展","kind":"activity","responsibility":"整理有效方法、困难和支持需求，更新后续培养建议。交付：培养复盘与后续计划。"},{"id":"p6_review","name":"接收与持续发展评审","phase":"接收与持续发展","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对职责变化与后续支持并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"exception_action","name":"实践障碍与培养路径调整","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对未改善的表现、工作条件与训练假设，调整实践机会、支持和培养路径。"},{"id":"exception_review","name":"恢复与重新准入","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对异常影响、处置证据与恢复状态，明确哪些工作需要重新评审；获得有权人确认后再进入正常推进路径。"}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"异常：专项处置"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"确认后重新评审"}]}'::jsonb),
('talent-development-advanced','f5904f6f2f3107bf1812f9fd1eec2080','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"Role and competency assessment","phase":"Competencies and role goals","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Assess responsibilities, performance and personal feedback alongside work conditions. Deliver: role competency and condition assessment."},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"Development goals and support needs","phase":"Competencies and role goals","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Agree target tasks, competencies and measures and define organizational support needs. Deliver: development goals and support brief."},{"id":"p1_review","name":"Competencies and role goals review","phase":"Competencies and role goals","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review role performance and competency gaps and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"Training and practice path","phase":"Development path design","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Design courses, mentoring, work practice and checks aligned with real tasks. Deliver: development path and practice plan."},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"Evaluation and feedback plan","phase":"Development path design","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Agree stage evidence, criteria, feedback and participant involvement. Deliver: development evaluation and feedback plan."},{"id":"p2_review","name":"Development path design review","phase":"Development path design","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review alignment of training, practice and evaluation and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"Learning materials and training readiness","phase":"Resources and mentoring readiness","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Prepare learning content, cases, practice and support against the objectives. Deliver: learning and training materials."},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"Mentors and practice tasks","phase":"Resources and mentoring readiness","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Confirm mentors, practice opportunities, timing and work support and record the agreement. Deliver: mentor and practice arrangements."},{"id":"p3_review","name":"Resources and mentoring readiness review","phase":"Resources and mentoring readiness","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review materials, mentors and practice conditions and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"Training participation and feedback","phase":"Training and trial practice","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Deliver agreed training and coaching and record understanding, difficulties and results. Deliver: training progress and feedback."},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"Trial practice and observation","phase":"Training and trial practice","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Complete trial tasks with support and observe performance and areas to improve. Deliver: trial practice and observation."},{"id":"p4_review","name":"Training and trial practice review","phase":"Training and trial practice","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review training progress and practice feedback and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"Real tasks and mentor observation","phase":"Role practice and verification","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Apply learning to real work and record results, mentor feedback and barriers. Deliver: role practice and mentor record."},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"Competency and outcome checks","phase":"Role practice and verification","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Check improvement against goals and distinguish learning effects from changing work conditions. Deliver: competency and outcome verification."},{"id":"p5_review","name":"Role practice and verification review","phase":"Role practice and verification","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review real-task performance and competency improvement and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"Result receipt and development agreement","phase":"Receipt and continued development","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Confirm development results and role application with participant and manager findings. Deliver: development results and agreement."},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"Retrospective and plan maintenance","phase":"Receipt and continued development","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review effective methods, barriers and support and update future development proposals. Deliver: development retrospective and future plan."},{"id":"p6_review","name":"Receipt and continued development review","phase":"Receipt and continued development","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review responsibility changes and ongoing support and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"exception_action","name":"Practice barriers and development adjustment","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review unimproved performance, work conditions and learning assumptions and adjust practice, support and development paths."},{"id":"exception_review","name":"Recovery and readiness review","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Check impact, response evidence and recovery status. Identify reviews to repeat and obtain authorized confirmation before resuming."}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"Exception response"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Confirmed re-review"}]}'::jsonb),
('business-process-advanced','d5249877385d17faddb97601db6df794','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"问题与利益方确认","phase":"问题与目标","kind":"activity","responsibility":"明确需要改善的问题、影响、相关人员和工作边界。交付：问题与利益方说明。"},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"目标与评价基线","phase":"问题与目标","kind":"activity","responsibility":"定义可比较指标、基线和成功范围，记录目标的依据。交付：目标与评价基线。"},{"id":"p1_review","name":"问题与目标评审","phase":"问题与目标","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对客户需求、问题范围与改进目标并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"现状流程与交接映射","phase":"测量与现状","kind":"activity","responsibility":"记录实际流程、等待、返工和交接，核对与书面规则的差异。交付：现状流程与交接图。"},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"数据采集与测量核验","phase":"测量与现状","kind":"activity","responsibility":"收集基线数据，核对口径、样本、缺失和测量误差。交付：测量与基线证据。"},{"id":"p2_review","name":"测量与现状评审","phase":"测量与现状","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对测量可信度与现状证据并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"根因假设与验证","phase":"根因与改进设计","kind":"activity","responsibility":"用现状证据检验原因，区分症状、关联和可控制因素。交付：根因分析与验证。"},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"流程与工具改进方案","phase":"根因与改进设计","kind":"activity","responsibility":"提出流程、职责、信息或工具调整，说明依赖、风险和预期结果。交付：改进方案与风险评估。"},{"id":"p3_review","name":"根因与改进设计评审","phase":"根因与改进设计","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对根因证据与方案可行性并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"试点执行与观察","phase":"试点与验证","kind":"activity","responsibility":"成员在确认范围内试行改进，记录实际操作、成本和问题。交付：试点与观察记录。"},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"效果比较与验证","phase":"试点与验证","kind":"activity","responsibility":"按同一口径比较改进前后结果，核对附加影响与不确定性。交付：效果验证与比较。"},{"id":"p4_review","name":"试点与验证评审","phase":"试点与验证","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对试点效果与附加影响并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"流程规范与培训推广","phase":"推广与接收","kind":"activity","responsibility":"制作流程、职责和工作材料，安排相关人员理解与试用。交付：流程规范与培训材料。"},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"工具与运行支持接收","phase":"推广与接收","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对工具、数据、监控和支持，记录实际接收与未完成项。交付：运行接收与支持计划。"},{"id":"p5_review","name":"推广与接收评审","phase":"推广与接收","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对可用流程、人员与支持并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"控制计划与异常响应","phase":"持续控制与复盘","kind":"activity","responsibility":"定义持续指标、观察和异常处理责任，登记偏离目标的情况。交付：控制与异常管理记录。"},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"收益与改进复盘","phase":"持续控制与复盘","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对持续收益、人员反馈和新增问题，提出下一轮改进范围。交付：持续改进与收益报告。"},{"id":"p6_review","name":"持续控制与复盘评审","phase":"持续控制与复盘","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对指标、异常和责任维护并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"exception_action","name":"试点偏差与方案纠正","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对试点偏差与附加影响，调整措施、测量或根因假设，取得确认后重试。"},{"id":"exception_review","name":"恢复与重新准入","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对异常影响、处置证据与恢复状态，明确哪些工作需要重新评审；获得有权人确认后再进入正常推进路径。"}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"异常：专项处置"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"确认后重新评审"}]}'::jsonb),
('business-process-advanced','c184ff4204ec7f31894f301acab3d6e1','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"Problem and stakeholder confirmation","phase":"Problem and goals","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Define the problem, impact, stakeholders and work boundaries. Deliver: problem and stakeholder brief."},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"Goals and measurement baseline","phase":"Problem and goals","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Define comparable metrics, baselines and success boundaries with supporting rationale. Deliver: goals and measurement baseline."},{"id":"p1_review","name":"Problem and goals review","phase":"Problem and goals","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review customer needs, problem boundaries and goals and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"Current process and handoff mapping","phase":"Measurement and current state","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Map actual work, waits, rework and handoffs and compare them with documented rules. Deliver: current process and handoff map."},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"Data collection and measurement checks","phase":"Measurement and current state","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Collect baseline data and check definitions, samples, missing values and measurement errors. Deliver: measurement and baseline evidence."},{"id":"p2_review","name":"Measurement and current state review","phase":"Measurement and current state","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review measurement reliability and current-state evidence and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"Causal hypotheses and validation","phase":"Causes and improvement design","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Test causes against evidence and distinguish symptoms, correlations and controllable factors. Deliver: causal analysis and validation."},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"Process and tooling improvements","phase":"Causes and improvement design","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Propose process, responsibility, information or tool changes with dependencies and expected effects. Deliver: improvement proposals and risks."},{"id":"p3_review","name":"Causes and improvement design review","phase":"Causes and improvement design","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review causal evidence and solution feasibility and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"Pilot execution and observation","phase":"Pilot and validation","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Members trial approved improvements and record actions, costs and issues. Deliver: pilot and observation record."},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"Outcome comparison and verification","phase":"Pilot and validation","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Compare results using consistent definitions and review side effects and uncertainty. Deliver: outcome verification and comparison."},{"id":"p4_review","name":"Pilot and validation review","phase":"Pilot and validation","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review pilot outcomes and side effects and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"Process guidance and training","phase":"Adoption and receipt","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Prepare process guidance, responsibilities and materials and arrange learning and trial use. Deliver: process guidance and training materials."},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"Tooling and operational support receipt","phase":"Adoption and receipt","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Verify tools, data, monitoring and support and record receipt and open items. Deliver: operational receipt and support plan."},{"id":"p5_review","name":"Adoption and receipt review","phase":"Adoption and receipt","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review usable processes, people and support and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"Control plan and exception response","phase":"Ongoing control and retrospective","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Define ongoing measures, observation and exception ownership and record deviations. Deliver: control and exception management."},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"Benefits and improvement review","phase":"Ongoing control and retrospective","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review sustained benefits, user feedback and new problems and propose the next improvement scope. Deliver: improvement and benefits report."},{"id":"p6_review","name":"Ongoing control and retrospective review","phase":"Ongoing control and retrospective","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review metrics, exceptions and maintained ownership and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"exception_action","name":"Pilot deviations and solution correction","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Check deviations and side effects, revise measures, measurement or causal assumptions, and repeat after approval."},{"id":"exception_review","name":"Recovery and readiness review","phase":"Exceptions and recovery","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Check impact, response evidence and recovery status. Identify reviews to repeat and obtain authorized confirmation before resuming."}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"Accepted"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Needs revision"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"Exception response"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"Confirmed re-review"}]}'::jsonb),
('project-delivery-advanced','ca4f9563b9962c4f1e8d461a98528668','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"目标范围与利益方","phase":"目标与治理","kind":"activity","responsibility":"明确项目目标、成果、范围、约束和需要参与确认的人员。交付：项目目标与范围说明。"},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"职责与协作规则","phase":"目标与治理","kind":"activity","responsibility":"约定沟通、资料、审阅、变更与验收责任，不将流程图视为权限授予。交付：项目协作与职责约定。"},{"id":"p1_review","name":"目标与治理评审","phase":"目标与治理","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对项目价值、范围与确认职责并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"成果拆分与依赖计划","phase":"计划与基线","kind":"activity","responsibility":"拆分可交付成果和工作，明确真实前置关系、交接与并行范围。交付：成果与依赖计划。"},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"资源风险与验收计划","phase":"计划与基线","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对人员、资源、关键风险和阶段验收证据，建立计划基线。交付：资源风险与验收基线。"},{"id":"p2_review","name":"计划与基线评审","phase":"计划与基线","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对任务、依赖、资源与验收依据并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"主交付工作流","phase":"并行工作执行","kind":"activity","responsibility":"成员在本地执行已确认工作，提交阶段成果、状态和需要协调的事项。交付：主工作流阶段成果。"},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"支撑资料与协作工作流","phase":"并行工作执行","kind":"activity","responsibility":"同步准备资料、资源和跨团队支持，记录问题与交接。交付：支撑成果与协作记录。"},{"id":"p3_review","name":"并行工作执行评审","phase":"并行工作执行","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对工作成果、支持与问题记录并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"成果整合与依赖核对","phase":"整合与阶段验证","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对跨工作流接口、成果版本、未满足依赖和交接记录。交付：整合与依赖核对。"},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"阶段成果与问题审阅","phase":"整合与阶段验证","kind":"activity","responsibility":"对照阶段标准核对成果、证据与问题，提出需要确认的调整。交付：阶段审阅与问题清单。"},{"id":"p4_review","name":"整合与阶段验证评审","phase":"整合与阶段验证","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对整合结果与交接完整性并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"最终验收与范围确认","phase":"验收与移交","kind":"activity","responsibility":"由有权人核对最终成果与标准，明确未完成事项和验收决定。交付：最终验收与决定。"},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"资料与运行责任移交","phase":"验收与移交","kind":"activity","responsibility":"交付资料、使用和维护责任，记录接收方对成果的实际确认。交付：移交与接收记录。"},{"id":"p5_review","name":"验收与移交评审","phase":"验收与移交","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对最终成果、验收依据与接收并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"p6_work1","name":"结项资料与责任核对","phase":"结项与收益观察","kind":"activity","responsibility":"归档成果、决定、版本和剩余安排，确认项目关闭条件。交付：结项资料与未完成事项。"},{"id":"p6_work2","name":"收益观察与协作复盘","phase":"结项与收益观察","kind":"activity","responsibility":"检查目标收益和使用反馈，整理后续机会及协作改进建议。交付：收益与协作复盘。"},{"id":"p6_review","name":"结项与收益观察评审","phase":"结项与收益观察","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对结项完整性与后续收益并记录有权人的评审结论。通过后推进；缺项时列明问题与责任人，按退回连线修订。"},{"id":"exception_action","name":"交付变更与升级协调","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"activity","responsibility":"核对偏差、依赖和范围变化，提出替代方案、资源或计划调整，交由有权人确认。"},{"id":"exception_review","name":"恢复与重新准入","phase":"异常处置与恢复","kind":"decision","responsibility":"核对异常影响、处置证据与恢复状态，明确哪些工作需要重新评审；获得有权人确认后再进入正常推进路径。"}],"edges":[{"from":"p1_work1","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_work2","to":"p1_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p1_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p1_review","to":"p2_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_work1","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_work2","to":"p2_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p2_review","to":"p3_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_work1","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_work2","to":"p3_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p3_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p3_review","to":"p4_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p4_work1","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_work2","to":"p4_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p4_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_work1","to":"p5_work2","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_work2","to":"p5_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p5_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p5_review","to":"p6_work2","kind":"sequence","label":"通过"},{"from":"p6_work1","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_work2","to":"p6_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"p6_review","to":"p6_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"未通过：修订"},{"from":"p4_review","to":"exception_action","kind":"sequence","label":"异常：专项处置"},{"from":"exception_action","to":"exception_review","kind":"sequence","label":""},{"from":"exception_review","to":"p2_work1","kind":"feedback","label":"确认后重新评审"}]}'::jsonb),
('project-delivery-advanced','742cb8927e904ad5f1803981761399af','{"nodes":[{"id":"p1_work1","name":"Goals, scope and stakeholders","phase":"Goals and governance","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Define goals, results, scope, constraints and people responsible for confirmation. Deliver: project goals and scope brief."},{"id":"p1_work2","name":"Responsibilities and collaboration","phase":"Goals and governance","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Agree communication, materials, reviews, changes and acceptance without treating diagrams as authority. Deliver: project collaboration and responsibility agreement."},{"id":"p1_review","name":"Goals and governance review","phase":"Goals and governance","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review project value, scope and decision responsibilities and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p2_work1","name":"Deliverable breakdown and dependencies","phase":"Planning and baseline","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Break down deliverables and work with actual prerequisites, handoffs and parallel scope. Deliver: deliverables and dependency plan."},{"id":"p2_work2","name":"Resources, risks and acceptance plan","phase":"Planning and baseline","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review people, resources, risks and stage acceptance evidence to establish a baseline. Deliver: resources, risks and acceptance baseline."},{"id":"p2_review","name":"Planning and baseline review","phase":"Planning and baseline","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review tasks, dependencies, resources and acceptance evidence and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p3_work1","name":"Primary delivery workstream","phase":"Parallel work delivery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Members deliver approved work locally and report results, status and coordination needs. Deliver: primary workstream results."},{"id":"p3_work2","name":"Supporting information and coordination","phase":"Parallel work delivery","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Prepare supporting information, resources and cross-team assistance with issue and handoff records. Deliver: supporting results and coordination record."},{"id":"p3_review","name":"Parallel work delivery review","phase":"Parallel work delivery","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review work results, support and issue records and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p4_work1","name":"Result integration and dependency checks","phase":"Integration and stage verification","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Verify workstream interfaces, versions, unmet dependencies and handoffs. Deliver: integration and dependency checks."},{"id":"p4_work2","name":"Stage results and issue review","phase":"Integration and stage verification","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Review results, evidence and issues against stage criteria and propose adjustments. Deliver: stage review and issue list."},{"id":"p4_review","name":"Integration and stage verification review","phase":"Integration and stage verification","kind":"decision","responsibility":"Review integrated results and complete handoffs and record the authorized human decision. Advance after acceptance; document issues and owners before returning work."},{"id":"p5_work1","name":"Final acceptance and scope confirmation","phase":"Acceptance and handover","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Authorized humans review final results and criteria and record open items and acceptance decisions. Deliver: final acceptance and decision."},{"id":"p5_work2","name":"Materials and operational ownership handoff","phase":"Acceptance and handover","kind":"activity","responsibility":"Hand over materials, use and maintenance ownership and record actual receiving confirmation. Deliver: handover and receipt record."},{"id":